            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Desktop open: empty cavity and raised lid visible without clipping. Rear hinges and released upper latch have visually under-explained attachment/gaps; terrain is hidden behind lid.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/niger/desktop-open.png"
            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Mobile closed: complete model, title and controls fit. Low dunes and dark feet lose definition; body/brass palette has limited separation.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/niger/mobile-closed.png"
            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Mobile open: full lid, projecting latch and feet fit; hollow opening readable. Small hinge connections cannot be resolved; Close lid label matches pose.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/niger/mobile-open.png"
            }
          ],
          "limitations": [
            "Wood-like rather than unambiguously mineral body; shallow dunes and generic faceted rock.",
            "Conspicuous closed seam and apparent open hardware separation are disclosed presentation limitations, not independently established mechanical failures."
